--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: E1_MG5_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4e04fe2e0b43d5449b2134802884e59c, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 21002063872
    m_Localized: That's it Lyra, we've seen all the steps involved in making a t-shirt.
      I hope you've remembered each step, because all that work goes into it... just
      for one piece of cloth!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 486305566720
    m_Localized: Yes, I had no idea it would take so much time and resources. It's
      amazing! Well, can we go home now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 587568648192
    m_Localized: Not so fast! We've seen how clothes are made... but how do you think
      they get to the stores?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8958078226432
    m_Localized: Exactly! This is what we call importing. Clothes sometimes travel
      thousands of kilometers before landing in boutiques around the world. And that
      has an impact on our planet...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9181852733440
    m_Localized: By the way, look, we've arrived at the clothing import center! This
      is where it all happens!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9430738538496
    m_Localized: This place is huge! So this is where all the clothes are managed
      and sent!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10142100885504
    m_Localized: Exactly! And you'll be in charge of importing his clothes all over
      the world!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10250502672384
    m_Localized: When you're ready, press the big button and I'll explain the next
      mini-game.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10565801086976
    m_Localized: Take a look at the T-shirt on the bottom left of your screen, and
      click on it to find out all about it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10787453276160
    m_Localized: Now that you've got all the information you need about the T-shirt,
      it's up to you to make its way to the store! You can choose between 4 means
      of transport.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11520386928640
    m_Localized: You have to choose the best option to pollute as little as possible.
      You have the right to choose several means of transport, but the more you use,
      the more you pollute, so think carefully!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11640817979392
    m_Localized: Oh! It's like a puzzle! I just have to find the right combination.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11725375148032
    m_Localized: Exactly, Lyra! Do you want to do the first one together?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11855155302400
    m_Localized: All right! First, you need to find the starting and finishing points
      of your suit. See if there's a sea or ocean between them, then it's up to you
      to press the transports in the order you think is right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35517828829184
    m_Localized: They are manufactured in the countries where they are sold
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35529832927232
    m_Localized: They are shipped from their country of manufacture
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35658799386624
    m_Localized: Sheep from all over the world mail them to each other
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 42505191165952
    m_Localized: No, it's not that. Try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50648746954752
    m_Localized: Bravo Lyra you didn't get fooled by his disguises! You've kept your
      environmental conscience and that's great!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50907455819776
    m_Localized: Yes, I'm not naive and I recognized him well behind his ridiculous
      get-up!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50920655294464
    m_Localized: 'More good news: we''ve delivered all the clothes to their delivery
      points, so now it''s time to calculate your score!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52049417998336
    m_Localized: Excellent choice! You've combined two effective and reasonable means.
      This shirt took its time, but the planet thanks you! Moving on!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52454143168512
    m_Localized: Great job! You've thought about the planet while finding a realistic
      route. These jeans arrive beautifully and without polluting too much.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52446933159936
    m_Localized: You're becoming a real strategist! It's a great ride, both realistic
      and environmentally friendly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52487655657472
    m_Localized: Well done! You've crossed the ocean without polluting the air, and
      the last stretch is reasonable. Mission accomplished!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52503501737984
    m_Localized: Perfect! Short, to the point and very reasonable. You got it right
      the first time!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52523005251584
    m_Localized: It's fast, it's true... but planes pollute a lot. Sometimes, taking
      your time is better for the planet! You'll know next time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52561156640768
    m_Localized: Not bad at all! It's a bit longer and more circuitous, but it works.
      Bravo for your logical mind!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52581733896192
    m_Localized: Well done! It's a good solution, even if trucks pollute a little
      more than trains.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52602705416192
    m_Localized: It's fast, but this flight left a heavy pollution trail behind.
      We can do better!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52618127872000
    m_Localized: It's fast, but for such a short trip, you don't need to fly. Try
      a gentler alternative.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52682036482048
    m_Localized: Hmm... Haven't you forgotten something? You have to cross the ocean!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52715876126720
    m_Localized: "You can't drive a boat or a plane \u2013 pick something else!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
